{"verse_key": "10:77", "surah": 10, "verse": 77, "text_uthmani": "قَالَ مُوسَىٰٓ أَتَقُولُونَ لِلْحَقِّ لَمَّا جَآءَكُمْ ۖ أَسِحْرٌ هَـٰذَا وَلَا يُفْلِحُ ٱلسَّـٰحِرُونَ", "translation": "Moses said, \"Do you say [thus] about the truth when it has come to you? Is this magic? But magicians will not succeed.\"", "verse_from_ms": 1724330, "verse_to_ms": 1740870, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "قَالَ", "start_ms": 1724330, "end_ms": 1725200}, {"i": 1, "text": "مُوسَىٰٓ", "start_ms": 1725200, "end_ms": 1726170}, {"i": 2, "text": "أَتَقُولُونَ", "start_ms": 1726170, "end_ms": 1728950}, {"i": 3, "text": "لِلْحَقِّ", "start_ms": 1728950, "end_ms": 1730220}, {"i": 4, "text": "لَمَّا", "start_ms": 1730220, "end_ms": 1731560}, {"i": 5, "text": "جَآءَكُمْ", "start_ms": 1731560, "end_ms": 1734040}, {"i": 6, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 1734040, "end_ms": 1735070}, {"i": 7, "text": "أَسِحْرٌ", "start_ms": 1735070, "end_ms": 1735840}, {"i": 8, "text": "هَـٰذَا", "start_ms": 1735840, "end_ms": 1736460}, {"i": 9, "text": "وَلَا", "start_ms": 1736460, "end_ms": 1737290}, {"i": 10, "text": "يُفْلِحُ", "start_ms": 1737290, "end_ms": 1740375}, {"i": 11, "text": "ٱلسَّـٰحِرُونَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}